From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lkshrk <dev@harke.me>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 04:38:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 06/13] Add apm outdated --json

Callers that consume outdated results had to parse a table drawn for
humans, whose box style, column set and cell wrapping vary. The new flag
prints every checked row as {"dependencies": [...]}, with the same
fields as the table plus wanted, outside_constraint and extra_tags.
Progress and log output stay off stdout in this mode; a missing
lockfile is reported on stderr as {"error": "no_lockfile"}.

Version 0.35.0+omni.6.

(cherry picked from commit 046d594d360e872ba4b092f4e2afa80f48fbddc6)
